redfin 1246: a lost Touch ID catacomb load restarts biometrickitd once sweetfpcd is connected, kern.sweet_mesa_reload (default 0)

No BiometricSupport message re-runs loadCatacomb: 0xe3ff800d only runs initSensor + syncTemplateListForUser, and
with biometrickitd's list emptied by a failed load that sync would remove TA templates it does not know. A process
start is the native reload path (biometrickitd is an EnablePressuredExit job: iOS restarts it routinely).
Lost load = a user 64 failed offline (after the 1245 wait) or sweetfpcd's TA_FRESH while the catacomb was loaded.
Bit 0: at the connect call (1.5 s after the bridge opens, now also with kern.sweet_mesa_offline 0) or 1.5 s after
a lost load while connected, SIGKILL the biometrickitd that opened AppleBiometricServices (name re-checked)
instead of sending 800d; launchd relaunches it on demand and it loads again (60 says present, not loaded). At
most once per 20 s, 3 times until a load succeeds. kern.sweet_mesa_reload_state: counters. 0 = as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
